{"lang":"ms_MY","spec":"bim-compiler prompts/VOCAB_MESSAGE_CATALOG.md §10","sources":["x_ms_MY/ms_MY"],"texts":["Display encryption - all characters are displayed as '*'. \r\nWith Data storage encryption you will not be able to report the data via SQL","Nama Wilayah","The Start Date indicates the first or starting date of a range.","Lokasi atau Alamat","Aturan-aturan akunting","Jumlah saldo debet terhitung","Jumlah saldo kredit terhitung","This tab contain accounting information","The Accounting Tab checkbox indicates if this window contains accounting information.","This tab contains translation information","The Translation Tab checkbox indicate if a tab contains translation information.","The Replenish Type indicates if this product will be manually re-ordered, ordered when the quantity is below the minimum quantity or ordered when it is below the maximum quantity.","The terms for Payment of this transaction","Payment Terms identify the method and timing of payment for this transaction.  ","The Sales Order is a control document.  The Sales Order is complete when the quantity ordered is the same as the quantity shipped and invoiced.","It is invoiced","Indicator if invoiced","The Costing Method indicates how costs will be calculated (Standard, Average)","Account yang digunakan","\r\nMenghubungkan ruangan untuk jadual-jadual Multi-Parent \r\n","\r\nRuangan hubungan menunjukkan setiap ruangan adalah kunci utama untuk situasi di mana terdapat lebih daripada satu induk.  Hanya takrifkan, jika jadual mempunyai lebih daripada satu ruangan induk (e.g. AD_User_Roles).\r\n","\r\nBahasa untuk Rakan Kongsi Niaga jika Multi-Bahasa ditukar\r\n","\r\nMenu Bahasa mengenalpasti bahasa yang digunakan untuk paparan dan membentuk maklumat.\r\n","Product Number of the Business Partner","The Business Partner Product Number identifies the number used by the Business Partner for this product.","Aktifitas Bisnis","Line Net Amount (Quantity * Actual Price) without Freight and Charges","Indicates the line net amount based on the quantity and the actual price.  Any additional charges or freight are not included.","The Relative Priority indicates the location to pick from first if an product is stored in more than one location.  (0 = highest priority)","Perbedaan hari aktual antara order dan pengiriman","The Purchase Order ","\r\nAliran kerja , langkah atau proses\r\n","\r\nNod aliran kerja menunjukkan satu langkah atau proses di dalam aliran kerja.\r\n","Alamat email","\r\nKadar Cukai untuk urus-niaga Kad kredit\r\n","\r\nKadar Cukai memaparkan jumlah keseluruhan cukai. Jumlah Cukai hanya digunakan untuk kad kredit yang diproses\r\n","Action has been requested","The Request Action indicates if the Credit Card Company has requested further action be taken.","\r\nMemastikan Rakan Niaga (Wakil Jualan)menerima keuntungan\r\n","\r\nRakan Niaga boleh menjadi penjual atau wakil jualan\r\n","Jumlah yang aktual","\r\nSistem Notis diperakui\r\n","\r\n\"Acknowledged checkbox\" menunjukkan jika notis ini tidak perlu dikekalkan.\r\n","Ini adalah transaksi penjualan (penerimaan)","\r\nMenyatakan nama pemasangan Compiere System, e.g. Joe Block, Inc \r\n","\r\nNama jika sistem ini membezakan kontrak-kontrak sokongan \r\n","The values of the actual Product Attributes","\r\nCiri-ciri nilai produk\r\n","\r\nNilai ciri-ciri produk yang sebenar. Ciri-ciri produk contoh dinyatakan dalam urusniaga sebenar \r\n","Sudah Selesai","Type of Cost","Verification of EMail Address","The field contains the date the EMail Address has been verified","\r\nDokumenkan jujukan nombor dokumen\r\n","\r\nNombor dokumen biasanya dihasilkan secara automatik oleh sistem dan ditentukan oleh jenis dokumen itu. Jika dokumen tidak disimpan, jumlah awal nombor dipaparkan dalam \"<>\".\r\nJika jenis dokumen tiada urutan dokumen ditakrifkan secara automatik, \"field\" adalah kosong jika dokumen baru dibuat. Ini kebiasaannya untuk dokumen yang mempunyai nombor luaran (cth : invois penjual).  Jika \"field\" dibiarkan kosong, sistem akan membuat nombor dokumen untuk anda. Urutan dokumen digunakan untuk \"fallback number\" yang ditakrifkan dalam \"Urutan Kekal\" window dengan nama \"DocumentNo_<TableName>\", di mana \"TableName\" adalah nama sebenar bagi jadual(e.g. C_Order).\r\n","\r\nKeadaan Nilai\r\n","Price Entered - the price based on the selected UoM","\r\nTulis semula segmen akaun Projek dengan nilai yang ditentukan \r\n","\r\nNilai kombinasi akaun asal digunakan jika tidak dapat ditulis semula. Jika dipilih, tetapi bukan ditentukan, segmen dibatalkan.\r\n","Encryption Key used for securing data content","Please note that changing the key will make ALL previously encrypted data unreadable.","Type of BOM Part","Type of Bill of Materials Part. A Standard Part (default) is always included in a BOM. An Optional Part can be selected in \"Drop BOM\". If a Part is member of one of the alternative groups, you can select one part in that group in the \"Drop BOM\" functionaly (example: either 64/256/512 MB Memory).","Bill of Material Product"],"fields":{"142":[-1,0],"169":[-1,0],"343":[1,-1],"483":[-1,2],"539":[3,-1],"704":[4,-1],"730":[5,-1],"731":[6,-1],"915":[3,-1],"927":[7,8],"928":[9,10],"995":[3,-1],"1052":[-1,11],"1063":[12,13],"1078":[-1,14],"1090":[15,16],"1099":[12,13],"1119":[-1,14],"1350":[4,-1],"1357":[-1,17],"1365":[4,-1],"1387":[-1,2],"1433":[4,-1],"1434":[18,-1],"1455":[4,-1],"1462":[4,-1],"1471":[4,-1],"1477":[4,-1],"1484":[4,-1],"1527":[4,-1],"1537":[3,-1],"1546":[19,20],"2124":[21,22],"2185":[3,-1],"2208":[3,-1],"2262":[12,13],"2279":[-1,14],"2314":[23,24],"2346":[18,-1],"2347":[6,-1],"2348":[5,-1],"2351":[4,-1],"2589":[25,-1],"2597":[25,-1],"2616":[25,-1],"2648":[4,-1],"2764":[25,-1],"2774":[12,13],"2880":[26,27],"2932":[-1,14],"2995":[26,27],"3057":[3,-1],"3105":[23,24],"3117":[-1,28],"3223":[15,16],"3224":[-1,14],"3284":[29,-1],"3290":[29,-1],"3318":[-1,30],"3323":[25,-1],"3331":[12,13],"3370":[26,27],"3402":[-1,30],"3416":[26,27],"3421":[-1,30],"34